 auf ebenfalls gestrandete Tritovore-Händler. Von ihnen erfahren der Doctor und Christina, dass San Helios einst von Milliarden bewohnt wurde. Schon bald wird klar, dass das Wurmloch und die Zerstörung von San Helios zusammenhängen und die Erde dazu bestimmt ist, das selbe Schicksal zu erfahren...","poster":"/9qKoF7XjkcbWYwekBCKt7W7rDHc.jpg","runtime":59.0,"title":"Doctor Who: Planet der Toten","type":"movie","va":7.5,"vc":229,"year":"2009"},"movie:356895":{"cast":[{"id":69483,"name":"Christina Brucato","photo":"/5yNLxKg9o3791d72j8XhalawFyE.jpg"},{"id":167566,"name":"Michael Potts","photo":"/3fgLuZkPH6F4RDjWeWt1s9bjy3v.jpg"},{"id":205797,"name":"Maria Dizzia","photo":"/sMsBH9o1kuFeVgjX2QoXvxccKJQ.jpg"},{"id":86919,"name":"Jamie Harrold","photo":"/vtBL6DCxCL2qCCh8aI6LRHOtc8V.jpg"},{"id":9284,"name":"Thomas Kopache","photo":"/kQOH3XyoGJqtQlBDCYh5o0R70Aa.jpg"},{"id":94432,"name":"Adrian Martinez","photo":"/id70SLEpj9jelZZepJlapaXH8lR.jpg"},{"id":1034197,"name":"Samira Wiley","photo":"/m45A0hYcpnGckwxqs7j0I6Sp2Dj.jpg"},{"id":1241637,"name":"Lucy Martin","photo":""}],"genres":["Drama"],"id":356895,"original":"37","overview":"Im März 1964 wird Kitty Genovese brutal ermordet. Trotz ihrer Hilfeschreie greift keiner der 37 Zeugen ein ...","poster":"/im8VaD4tu7lChxF9tUOG1H9sFzp.jpg","runtime":88.0,"title":"37","type":"movie","va":4.8,"vc":25,"year":"2016"},"movie:381482":{"cast":[{"id":1573371,"name":"Furkan Kızılay","photo":"/3fITteDKDjPe1EHG0tLrtXwAGo1.jpg"},{"id":1258531,"name":"Hazal Şenel","photo":"/6pKC0VoKDJuaJIcqOFusZMpDuLN.jpg"},{"id":1258833,"name":"Bükre Atala","photo":"/ctJwdWb31P7AGqysMUPvpMSOnBf.jpg"},{"id":1258828,"name":"Ahmet Yıldırım","photo":"/2U5d8CSj96VNN7yCkOI4rXNXzuU.jpg"},{"id":1157659,"name":"Fatma Karanfil","photo":"/6AH19hvdmN6h9MTnDjnuFOQf4Gc.jpg"},{"id":543958,"name":"Emin Gümüşkaya","photo":"/2t8cAlBoU9ibzaJe4uzmHPBhlzh.jpg"},{"id":1430808,"name":"Murat Ercanlı","photo":"/qursVmiT5CsJGWzWAYZnZGt4Rd5.jpg"},{"id":2062224,"name":"Umut Tanyolu","phot